WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.060
That brings us to the end of our session.

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:08.260
You are now officially prepared to be the difference in an emergency.

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:11.180
Remember the three big takeaways one last time.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:15.940
One, if someone is unresponsive, call 911 immediately.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:20.500
Two, if they are not breathing, start high quality CPR.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.100
Three, if an AED is available, turn it on and follow the voice prompts.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:31.080
Now is the time for any final questions, comments, or concerns.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:36.080
Whether it's about a specific technique we practiced or a what if scenario you're still

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:39.279
curious about, don't hesitate to ask.

00:00:39.279 --> 00:00:42.240
Thank you for your focus and your hard work today.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.200
You are leaving here with the skills and the confidence to act when it matters most.

